#: scenario8:scenario8_4D5B1952_FBB7_450D_B213_2EECB2E8B062
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83061cfd7dda9ac8e46af60be63f8688322bdb4ba7b02c4830c53addd7c970f2
#. default-sha256: 6e5dfa2eb4de77d3ac58243839665ef157f5abd0a2cc7ab162256db22dbc497d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4D5B1952_FBB7_450D_B213_2EECB2E8B062"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I remember the Silk Road,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫stretching out before me as far as the eye can see,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ricordo la Via della Seta,⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫che si estendeva davanti a me a perdita d’occhio,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E99D19E3_A167_4F57_A7DA_8791B0F2861E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c282aaf86af0a2db35e66a4e6dbc301bc701b57c79f3ab8a0ad8f95c0fd2730f
#. default-sha256: e01facfe913f9386241683813a809d5b9f05904de93459e1623c49267b1f5369
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E99D19E3_A167_4F57_A7DA_8791B0F2861E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫clouds of dust wisping across the bare dirt trail."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫e le nuvole di polvere che rivestivano il sentiero sterrato."

#: scenario8:scenario8_40E7908F_A47F_49C9_A203_5A99E5B51E79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 298d0475190d16a626e0721e4594b66bc17338e5023f86d36f86a8c453fe3707
#. default-sha256: e567a356121b2925ccf2980cb7dfb7bdee7163ec95eaac8e1472215aa3102edb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_40E7908F_A47F_49C9_A203_5A99E5B51E79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But beyond that,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ma a parte questo,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_A4526673_F606_486A_B4A8_F455E5DA6B49
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f40e8b559d341628b4f8709f9cfbfa9abf2afb8004c04f8bc632e0b073b4537
#. default-sha256: fcb2f14bea492b2f72e412a2cc7a9b9c5af482713952f9bf1ad1dcdc4bc21a23
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A4526673_F606_486A_B4A8_F455E5DA6B49"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can only clearly remember the last five years or so of my life.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫In my oldest "
"real memory, I was a slave."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Riesco a ricordare con chiarezza solo gli ultimi cinque anni della mia vita.⟪k:2⟫ Nei "
"più remoti dei miei ricordi, ero uno schiavo."

#: scenario8:scenario8_7A6735AE_C1A9_4B70_B191_D290FCD9996A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e902266389c6195218ca6d5151a6a6adf553c3216a3eecd30d26588673d9168
#. default-sha256: fb39ee43e7dc2a44b0b84c14c7017f069452133b5e82a350fd54ae8ccc79a9a3
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7A6735AE_C1A9_4B70_B191_D290FCD9996A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You have no idea what that’s like.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫How it feels to be abused and humiliated,⟪k:3⟫"
"desperate for food and water."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non hai idea di cosa si provi.⟪k:1⟫ A venire maltrattati ed umiliati,⟪k:2⟫alla disperata "
"ricerca di cibo e di acqua."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B462978E_C7DD_4FDE_A8A9_8D469051BEB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b908e5bced5b0a30f1fae10205210b5fac57e9a12676adb117877f563ccf2dc0
#. default-sha256: 6790224fdac45016e78d7936f6be28ae99ba7d7dd755354e37a59cdd1e96d3b1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B462978E_C7DD_4FDE_A8A9_8D469051BEB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh... ⟪k:1⟫I see.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫So as I was saying..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ah... ⟪k:1⟫capisco.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Dunque, come stavo dicendo..."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5D6BA232_6825_4A00_A986_8F8C0BFDBBE4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8160b0bce9ae54834728bee01c5630b2024b7944a55d5f9d26b037fdbe9c1cdb
#. default-sha256: 0190080996295c86bdd2b41cd645248770311ab9b08bae28c1574ac383eaec02
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5D6BA232_6825_4A00_A986_8F8C0BFDBBE4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But they were right about what I was deep down—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a beast—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫and my revenge "
"went far beyond what could be considered reasonable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma avevano ragione su ciò che ero nel profondo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫una bestia—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫e la mia "
"vendetta andò ben oltre i limiti della logica."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F9F2E4D1_B033_4ECD_A2BC_3268A2155534
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4dcc35a7a699244c410e5f4929c5c99bf5ee5bb19c06cacb36dde2004ae4eaa0
#. default-sha256: 4800d2b7a273080c5a2a42dddae0db9bcb8308af4aa4bc9c75412576cef15142
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F9F2E4D1_B033_4ECD_A2BC_3268A2155534"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Four years ago,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Quattro anni fa,"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9737F342_11CF_4BCE_8FD4_F42B0B6D45AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27c2bfad25fc601021779f0cb162f635cd4d01b802d7138f967883a40d65da9c
#. default-sha256: c2a06f9bb969fd98f0ffb1bdfe31e70359674663049594390362d561566dc06a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9737F342_11CF_4BCE_8FD4_F42B0B6D45AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was sitting in a carriage as it rattled along a dirt road. ⟪k:1⟫This was not the kind of "
"carriage you rode around town in, but a filthy slave transport."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫mi trovavo in un carro che percorreva una strada sterrata.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non era uno di quei "
"carri che si vedono in giro per le città,⟪k:3⟫bensì era un lurido trasporto di schiavi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0D1D9CD2_9C53_41BC_B3F0_18430F2CAD00
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f06c58dbf06dbd1d8f5123b9d303ea6d093fd41a3a862f4efbe894c1f6782278
#. default-sha256: f9937e7dda517be67b51287dd4c4c64ba77ea82f2964ce0adcac639a2c9241dc
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0D1D9CD2_9C53_41BC_B3F0_18430F2CAD00"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫There were men, young women, and even children.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Everyone wore a look of "
"hopelessness on their faces,⟪k:3⟫and no one had the strength left to resist."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫C’erano uomini, giovani donne, e perfino bambini.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Avevano tutti un’espressione "
"rassegnata, e a nessuno era rimasta la forza di opporsi."

#: scenario8:scenario8_1D886E58_66E2_49FB_9D60_309E65564CB9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d00e7d05ec4f39b167527efc430b1c2a9316781ca57d16934ae06c2336245e0
