#: scenario8:scenario8_642A33E2_32AC_4FED_BAD0_C646F20C4C99
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09710799e710cea46e6c4663e6100aea5f1c95df0d471fb3b8a39e704c22809f
