msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_642A33E2_32AC_4FED_BAD0_C646F20C4C99"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She gave assistance to anyone who sought it from her, without question, ⟪k:1⟫and as a "
"result, the church’s coffers quickly dried up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Forniva assistenza a chiunque gliela chiedesse, senza fare domande,⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫e come "
"conseguenza di ciò, i fondi della chiesa terminarono."

#: scenario8:scenario8_92250379_F847_47F5_9A2A_E0F63FB610C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46781e6053649158befb3795cf597b43974eb7fc5e53c9bcbd64a05611bb11ac
