msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_BB3DF870_0BA7_46FF_98A4_4D74F6E907FC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫If doing so would give her peace—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and if I could be a part of that peace—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"then I wanted to grant her wish."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se questo le avrebbe permesso di ottenere la pace—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫la stessa pace di cui io avrei "
"fatto parte—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫allora ero pronto a soddisfare il suo desiderio."

#: scenario8:scenario8_443D01AC_8CBB_4E47_A8B9_C2142714BAF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
