msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7B057AD5_2C87_441F_83EE_3D38C1EB2338"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Explain something to me, lord.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You said that if I helped you, the nun would be able "
"to save more people than she does now. ⟪k:3⟫So how does capturing this witch accomplish that?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Spiegami una cosa, lord.⟪k:1⟫ Hai detto che se ti aiuterò,⟪k:2⟫la suora sarà in grado di "
"salvare ancora più persone.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ma la cattura di una strega come riuscirà a garantirlo?"

#: scenario8:scenario8_995AE10E_06EB_49DC_9F2C_EFDC0AD5B608
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5703cdb83e3f9dd4d94e3c758143b70f772d1f5ccee40074e6937ee8f7b26c68
