msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...Selling it, then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...Intendi venderlo, dunque."

#: scenario8:scenario8_92A28EB0_C58A_4DD9_86D3_B05A72D7955E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
