msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Selling” isn’t quite the right word, but if that’s how you want to think of it, by all "
"means."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Venderlo” non è proprio il termine giusto,⟪k:2⟫ma se è così che vuoi pensarla, fa’ "
"pure."

#: scenario8:scenario8_CB719C18_A0B8_4822_B262_1D5E2F25C1D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32989bd47e3e04a671aa59606fcfe15118bd03ce740bfc45f36fc28a3a934b8e
#. default-sha256: e1a422b73eff1800d843faf0871d4b54429af9d61ad3754d62f1e5fbd1620720
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CB719C18_A0B8_4822_B262_1D5E2F25C1D4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫A single witch’s freedom is all it’ll cost for everyone here to come out happy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫La libertà di una singola strega sarà l’unico prezzo da pagare⟪k:2⟫per garantire la "
"felicità di tutti."

#: scenario8:scenario8_60840E14_2AF3_4F9F_8D76_E17EC9638A56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1253459a3bdca6946dc38c5b89b50818f756389a04f8d90b0aac740a1472d5a
